{"id": "lombard-chestnut-demolition-settlement", "title": "A historic home was demolished beyond its permit. The owner agreed to $400,000.", "seconds": 42.1, "voice": "elevenlabs:OUMCzFUTd0F4Q6lkLkco", "narrator": "Roxy", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "eb4b772e44038b7e", "words": 108, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "An enforcement notice at 950 Lombard Street listed a possible $250 daily charge.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 6.6, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["A", "demolition", "beyond", "its", "permit"], "sub": "950 Lombard Street"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.84, 1.23, 1.4, 1.67, 2.01, 2.54, 2.94, 3.29, 3.37, 3.88, 4.13, 4.52, 4.86, 5.31, 5.74]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Planning said a historic home had already been demolished.", "t0": 6.72, "t1": 9.62, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "planning", "kicker": "Planning Department", "text": "historic resource", "mark": "historic"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.48, 0.66, 0.75, 1.27, 1.57, 1.73, 2.02, 2.21]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The owner later obtained a permit.", "t0": 9.74, "t1": 11.6, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The owner later obtained a permit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.5, 0.83, 1.22, 1.29]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "After negotiations, the owner agreed to a $400,000 civil penalty.", "t0": 11.82, "t1": 16.61, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$400,000", "label": "Agreed penalty"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.37, 1.24, 1.38, 1.65, 2.0, 2.11, 2.21, 2.48, 2.84, 3.29, 3.74, 4.1]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Planning approved reconstruction of a matching building envelope.", "t0": 16.73, "t1": 20.13, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "planning", "kicker": "Planning Department", "text": "building envelope", "mark": "envelope"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.47, 0.92, 1.67, 1.78, 1.86, 2.34, 2.84]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The rebuilt main house had lost its historic eligibility.", "t0": 20.25, "t1": 23.53, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The rebuilt main house had lost its historic eligibility"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.65, 0.91, 1.21, 1.39, 1.71, 1.91, 2.43]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "In June 2017, the court imposed a five-year injunction on the owner.", "t0": 23.75, "t1": 28.11, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "planning", "kicker": "Court order", "text": "permit requirements", "mark": "permit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.57, 0.91, 1.5, 1.62, 1.9, 2.36, 2.44, 3.01, 3.61, 3.75, 3.92]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Late or incomplete settlement payment would violate the injunction.", "t0": 28.23, "t1": 31.99, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "planning", "kicker": "Court order", "text": "monetary settlement", "mark": "settlement"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.47, 0.7, 1.32, 1.8, 2.14, 2.31, 2.85, 2.98]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The City’s deposit date remains unverified.", "t0": 32.11, "t1": 34.78, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The City’s deposit date remains unverified"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.48, 0.99, 1.28, 1.74]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "The injunction also limited changes to the authorized footprint.", "t0": 34.9, "t1": 38.45, "shot": "detail0", "visual": {"type": "doc", "kicker": "San Francisco Planning Department and San Francisco Superior Court", "source": "planning", "text": "The injunction also limited changes to the authorized footprint", "mark": "The injunction also limited changes to the authorized footprint"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.76, 1.16, 1.55, 2.08, 2.2, 2.33, 2.89]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 38.57, "t1": 41.18, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.41, 0.8, 0.97, 1.29, 1.39, 1.48, 1.78, 2.11]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "The notice", "b": "The civil settlement", "o": "The court order"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "contrast"}